flowchart TD
    A[User asks PawPal about a pet] --> B[Input Processing]
    B --> C{Input Type}
    C -->|Image upload| D[Vision API]
    C -->|Text description| E[LLM / NLP Processing]

    D --> F[Extract pet features]
    E --> F

    F --> G[Pet Recognition Layer<br/>Example: orange/black/brown cat]
    G --> H[RAG Retrieval Layer]
    H --> I[Knowledge Base<br/>Pet facts, breed info, care tips]
    I --> J[Relevant Context Retrieved]
    J --> K[LLM Response Generation]
    K --> L[Helpful PawPal Answer<br/>Breed, behavior, care advice]
